<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{이름}} — {{목표}}</title>
<meta name="description" content="{{한줄소개}}">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #ffffff;
    --fg: #16191d;
    --muted: #5b6472;
    --line: #e2e6eb;
    --card: #f7f9fb;
    --accent: {{강조색}};
    --accent-soft: {{강조색_연한}};
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root {
      --bg: #14171a;
      --fg: #eceef1;
      --muted: #9aa4b2;
      --line: #2a2f36;
      --card: #1b1f24;
      --accent: {{강조색_다크}};
      --accent-soft: #232a33;
    }
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--fg);
    font-family: "Pretendard", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI",
      "Malgun Gothic", "Apple SD Gothic Neo", system-ui, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.75;
    font-size: 17px;
  }
  .wrap { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; }
  a { color: var(--accent); }

  .topbar {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-size: 14px;
    padding: 10px 0;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .topbar .wrap { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; }

  header.hero { padding: 56px 0 40px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .role {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: .04em;
    color: var(--accent);
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  h1 { font-size: 40px; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 14px; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
  .oneline { font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 10px; font-weight: 600; }
  .oneline-src { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 22px; }
  .lede { color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 26px; }
  nav.jump { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
  nav.jump a {
    font-size: 14px;
    text-decoration: none;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 7px 12px;
    color: var(--fg);
  }
  nav.jump a:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }

  section { padding: 46px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  h2 { font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: .08em; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 22px; text-transform: uppercase; }
  h3 { font-size: 19px; margin: 0 0 8px; }
  p { margin: 0 0 18px; }

  .story p:first-of-type { font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; }

  .ability { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .ability h3 { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .ability .note { color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 15px; }
  .quote { border-left: 3px solid var(--accent); padding: 2px 0 2px 14px; margin: 0 0 12px; }
  .quote:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .quote .when { font-size: 13px; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; display: block; }
  .quote .text { display: block; }
  .quote .src { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); display: block; }

  .numbers { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
  .num { background: var(--card); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; }
  .num .v { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.01em; display: block; }
  .num .k { font-size: 14px; display: block; margin-top: 2px; }
  .num .b { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); display: block; }
  .num .s { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); display: block; margin-top: 8px; }
  .numbers-note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; margin: 18px 0 0; }

  .work { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .work .no { font-size: 13px; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; }
  .work p { margin: 8px 0 14px; color: var(--muted); }
  .work a.btn {
    display: inline-block; font-size: 14px; text-decoration: none;
    border: 1px solid var(--accent); color: var(--accent);
    border-radius: 8px; padding: 7px 14px;
  }
  .work.pending { border-style: dashed; }
  .work.pending .badge { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); }

  table.tasks { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 15px; }
  table.tasks th, table.tasks td { text-align: left; padding: 10px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); vertical-align: top; }
  table.tasks th { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; }
  table.tasks td.n { color: var(--muted); white-space: nowrap; }

  footer { padding: 40px 0 64px; }
  footer .contact { font-size: 18px; margin: 0 0 10px; }
  footer .meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; margin: 0; }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    h1 { font-size: 31px; }
    .oneline { font-size: 18px; }
    body { font-size: 16px; }
    header.hero { padding: 36px 0 30px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="topbar"><div class="wrap">
  <span>{{이름}} · {{목표}} 지원용</span>
  {{상대트랙_링크}}
</div></div>

<header class="hero"><div class="wrap">
  <span class="role">{{목표}}</span>
  <h1>{{이름}}</h1>
  <p class="oneline">{{한줄소개}}</p>
  <p class="oneline-src">— {{한줄소개_출처}}</p>
  <p class="lede">{{첫화면_보조문}}</p>
  <nav class="jump">
    <a href="#story">이야기</a>
    <a href="#ability">세 가지 능력</a>
    <a href="#numbers">숫자</a>
    <a href="#works">대표작</a>
    <a href="#tasks">과제 기록</a>
  </nav>
</div></header>

<section id="story"><div class="wrap">
  <h2>이야기</h2>
  <div class="story">
{{이야기_본문}}
  </div>
</div></section>

<section id="ability"><div class="wrap">
  <h2>세 가지 능력이 드러난 기록</h2>
{{능력_카드}}
</div></section>

<section id="numbers"><div class="wrap">
  <h2>숫자</h2>
  <div class="numbers">
{{숫자_칸}}
  </div>
  <p class="numbers-note">{{숫자_안내}}</p>
</div></section>

<section id="works"><div class="wrap">
  <h2>대표작</h2>
{{대표작}}
</div></section>

<section id="tasks"><div class="wrap">
  <h2>과제 기록</h2>
  <table class="tasks">
    <thead><tr><th>과제</th><th>한 일</th><th>능력</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
{{과제_목록}}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div></section>

<footer><div class="wrap">
  <p class="contact">{{연락처}}</p>
  <p class="meta">{{하단_안내}}</p>
</div></footer>

</body>
</html>
